---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { TOOLS } from '../tools/registry';
import { localePath, ui, type Locale } from '../i18n';

interface Props { locale: Locale }
const { locale } = Astro.props;
const t = ui(locale);
const privacy = localePath(locale, '/privacy');
const link = 'text-accent underline underline-offset-2';
const repo = 'https://github.com/kimzam30/Nhako-tools';
---
<BaseLayout
  title={t.about}
  description={locale === 'ms'
    ? 'Nhako Tools ialah koleksi alat fail, kalkulator dan pembangun yang berjalan sepenuhnya dalam pelayar anda. Tiada muat naik, tiada akaun, tiada iklan.'
    : 'Nhako Tools is a set of file, calculator and developer utilities that run entirely in your browser. No upload, no account, no ads.'}
  path="/about"
  locale={locale}
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6">
    <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight">{t.about}</h1>

    {locale === 'ms' ? (
      <div class="mt-7 space-y-6 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">
        <p class="text-base text-text">
          {TOOLS.length} alat untuk PDF, imej, kalkulator, media dan kod, dan semuanya berjalan
          pada peranti anda, bukan pada pelayan.
        </p>
        <p>
          Kebanyakan alat dalam talian berfungsi dengan memuat naik fail anda, memprosesnya di
          tempat lain, dan menghantarnya kembali. Itu bermaksud menunggu muat naik, giliran, had
          saiz, biasanya had harian, dan selalunya akaun sebelum anda boleh memuat turun hasilnya.
          Semua itu tidak perlu lagi: pelayar boleh melakukan kerja ini secara terus.
        </p>
        <p>
          Jadi alat ini tiada langkah muat naik. Itu menjadikannya lebih pantas. Biasanya ia siap
          sebelum muat naik pun sempat selesai. Ia juga menjadikannya peribadi, kerana fail yang
          tidak pernah dihantar ke mana-mana tidak boleh bocor. Lihat
          <a class={link} href={privacy}>Privasi</a> untuk cara mengesahkannya sendiri.
        </p>
        <p>
          Tiada iklan, tiada kuki, tiada sepanduk kuki, tiada jualan tambahan. Satu-satunya ukuran
          ialah kiraan paparan halaman tanpa kuki, yang diterangkan di halaman Privasi. Laman ini
          sumber terbuka di bawah lesen MIT, dan
          <a class={link} href={repo} rel="noopener noreferrer">kod sumbernya ada di GitHub</a>
          jika anda mahu membaca atau menjalankannya sendiri.
        </p>
      </div>
    ) : (
      <div class="mt-7 space-y-6 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">
        <p class="text-base text-text">
          {TOOLS.length} utilities for PDFs, images, calculations, media and code, all of which
          run on your device rather than on a server.
        </p>
        <p>
          Most online tools work by uploading your file, processing it somewhere else, and
          sending it back. That means an upload wait, a queue, a size cap, usually a daily
          limit, and often an account before you can download the result. None of that is
          necessary any more: browsers can do this work directly.
        </p>
        <p>
          So these tools have no upload step. That makes them faster. They are usually finished
          before the upload would even have completed. It also happens to make them private,
          because a file that is never sent anywhere cannot leak. See
          <a class={link} href={privacy}>Privacy</a>
          for how to verify that claim rather than trust it.
        </p>
        <p>
          No ads, no cookies, no cookie banner, no upsell. The only measurement is a cookieless
          page-view count, described on the Privacy page. The site is open source under
          the MIT licence, and the
          <a class={link} href={repo} rel="noopener noreferrer">source is on GitHub</a>
          if you want to read it or run it yourself.
        </p>
      </div>
    )}
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
